	(text "PWR-004 DRAFT: LOAD, CAPACITANCE AND SHUTDOWN LIMITS\nMain allocation=0.750 MCU+0.500 radio+0.250 SDRAM\n+0.250 NOR+0.050 logic=1.800A (not measured maxima).\nAudio, SD, camera, display and lighting require separate supplies.\nAt full Vhi=3.584411411V, Vin=3.2V and ASSUMED eta=0.75:\nPout=Vhi*1.8=6.451941W; Pin=Pout/eta=8.602587W.\nIin=Pin/Vin=2.688309A; total stage loss=Pin-Pout=2.150647W.\n2.25A cold-load allocation: Pin=10.753234W; Iin=3.360386A.\n3A temporary screen: Pin=14.337646W; Iin=4.480514A.\n3A is NOT a qualified continuous rating or source permission.\nRadio OFF at cold start; 1.88A reference subtotal excludes extra charging.\nQualify actual loaded startup/ramp, current limit and hot enclosed losses.\n\nCold storage=147.21u direct+10u C43/FB1+300u C99/C100=457.21uF.\nKey filters add 0.4uF through resistors, not parallel loop capacitance.\nPartial lower C=110.21u*0.9*0.85*0.6+47u*0.8+300u*0.8*0.8\n=280.18639uF; residual factors are ALLOCATIONS, not guarantees.\nQualify 250..850uF loop window; total shutdown storage <=1mF.\nC97 internal VCC and input/bootstrap bypasses are NOT main-output C.\nC99/C100 initial leakage allowance=2*94.5uA=189uA.\n\nSYS-007 Rdis,max=11.4211ohm; key-return allowance Ir=1.5mA.\ntfall=Rdis*C*ln((3.6-Ir*Rdis)/(0.3-Ir*Rdis))+10ms.\nAt 850uF: 34.647839ms; at 1mF: 38.997458ms.\nExisting held-budget screen=46.589403ms; validate all rail/interface tails.\nVBATT tied to VCC requires the no-switch initialization/option contract.\nEnabled-VBATT 1ms/V fall requirement FAILS the retained-load screen.\nRequired firmware/option invariant is NOT implemented; see linked record.\nRUN buffer and held clamp connected; source protection NOT implemented.\nRail adoption blocked by SDRAM logic-high conflict #846.\nNo power-up or fabrication release at this checkpoint.\n\nFull sources, assumptions and executable Python:\n../design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md PWR-004; SYS-007/009 interfaces."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.646 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md")
		)
		(uuid "1f543ca1-6993-4fc1-a150-4c3cd26bfea2")
	)
	(text "PWR-004 RUN CONTROL: U16/C101, R68-R71, Q3; R34=110k\nU16 VCC=raw SYS_AON; A=MAIN_PWR_EN; Y->R68 1k->U13 RUN.\nR69=68k RUN-to-GND. Q3 drain=RUN after R68; source=GND.\nQ3 gate=POWER_OFF_H via R70 1k; R71=1M gate-to-GND.\nRUN/KILL/discharge/USB-clear drains remain separate.\nResistor screen: rmin=0.99^2; rmax=1.01^2.\nMAIN_PWR_EN adverse leakage allocation=3.8uA.\nPOR sink=(1.3-0.2)/(110k*rmin)+3.8uA\n        =14.003041uA <15uA test condition.\nENhigh at held 2.7V=2.7-3.8uA*110k*rmax=2.273598V.\nAt raw 3.263705831V, held drop<=0.250V: ENhigh>=2.587304V.\nCorrelate raw/held states with buffer thresholds; interpolation is a screen.\nRUNhigh=(3.2-0.1-1uA*1k*rmax)/(1+1k*rmax/(68k*rmin))\n       =3.052262V.\nRUNlow<=0.1+1uA*1k*rmax=0.101020V.\nBuffer DC load<=4.6/(68k*rmin)+1uA=70.021uA <100uA.\nAt raw=0: RUN<=(2uA Ioff+1uA allocation)*68k*rmax=0.208100V.\nThis endpoint does not cover undefined buffer behavior below 1.65V.\nHeld Q3 clamp supplies shutdown during raw collapse.\n\nFour gate branches include the future USB-clear branch:\nIpeak<=4*4.6/(1k*rmin)=18.773595mA <50mA absolute limit.\nIdc<=4*(4.6/(1M*rmin)+1uA)=22.773595uA <100uA.\nVGSmin=(2.6-1uA*1k*rmax)/(1+1k*rmax/(1M*rmin))\n      =2.596278V.\nWith installed FET R<=0.2ohm: RUN<=4.6*0.2/(1k*rmin+0.2)\n                               =0.938488mV.\nHeld-control spare=1125-500-500-4-22.773595=98.226405uA.\n1uA leakage and 0.2ohm are qualification allocations, not hot guarantees.\nRetain shared 10ms total response and 1uC transition reserve.\nSeparate proposed eFuse MR/FLT load is NOT included.\nSaved draft only: #846 rail/SDRAM conflict remains unresolved.\nFull sources, assumptions and Python: ../design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.446 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md")
		)
		(uuid "2609bf8c-db8e-4606-82f6-a0db60db90f9")
	)
	(text "MAIN DIGITAL SUPPLY: LTC3119 DRAFT / PWR-004\nRUN buffer and held shutdown clamp connected.\n3.4185V proposal NOT ADOPTED: SDRAM logic margin fails (#846).\nSource protection and whole-product verification remain incomplete.\nNOT FOR POWER-UP OR FABRICATION."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.646 37.846 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/issues/846")
		)
		(uuid "44af95d7-9f7c-44fe-9736-b6cbce342565")
	)
	(text "PWR-004: SETPOINT AND COMPENSATION\nU13 LTC3119IUFD#PBF; fixed PWM; MPPC disabled via VCC.\nR41=33k; R42=10k; each 0.1%, 25ppm/C.\nVnom=0.795*(1+33k/10k)=3.418500V.\nFor 100C resistor excursion:\nfLo=0.999*0.9975=0.9965025; fHi=1.001*1.0025=1.0035025.\nVlo=0.779*(1+33k*fLo/(10k*fHi))-100nA*33k*fHi\n   =3.328456349V.\nVhi=0.811*(1+33k*fHi/(10k*fLo))+100nA*33k*fHi\n   =3.509411411V.\n100nA is total adverse FB-current ALLOCATION, not a hot guarantee.\nTotal remaining regulation/routing/ripple/transient allowance=+/-75mV.\nFull acceptance envelope=3.253456349..3.584411411V.\nMCU release margin=3.253456349-3.193951250=59.505099mV.\nRadio margin=3.253456349-0.0875-3.139621574=26.334775mV.\n3.6V ceiling margin=3.6-3.584411411=15.588589mV.\nThese are acceptance budgets, not measured or guaranteed waveforms.\n\nL2=3.3uH +/-20%; qualify installed 2..4.4uH and hot current.\nR66=162k; f=100MHz/(8+1.2*162)=494.071kHz.\nResistor-only corners=484.713..503.699kHz; silicon variation extra.\nR67=42.2k in SERIES with C98=4.7nF C0G from VC to GND.\nReduced model, 2160 corners: fc=1.417..9.966kHz; PM>=51.167deg.\nMaximum modeled 0.5A-step excursion=66.112mV.\nModel omits distributed PDN, parasitics, delay and saturation.\nInstalled loop-gain, startup, thermal and transient tests REQUIRED.\n\nFull equations, primary sources and executable Python:\n../design/main_regulator_ltc3119.md PWR-004."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.646 190.246 0)
